{
  "id": 8867095445703,
  "title": "Crocodile Patchwork Printed Quilts, Animal Patchwork Bedding",
  "handle": "crocodile-patchwork-printed-quilts-animal-patchwork-bedding",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace rustic elegance and create a cozy haven with our Jeminise Crocodile Patchwork Quilt Set, perfect for adding a touch of warmth and tradition to any bedroom. This versatile quilt set features classic patchwork patterns and offers personalization options to make it a truly unique and thoughtful gift for loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Featuring a charming Crocodile Patchwork style, bringing rustic elegance and a touch of the countryside to your bedroom decor.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An ideal gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt by adding a name and selecting optional pillowcases to create a unique and cherished item.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in 5 convenient sizes: Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102''x91'').</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from soft and durable polycotton fabric for comfort and long-lasting use.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; simply wash separately and air dry without heat for best results, ensuring it remains fluffy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set typically includes 1 Quilt, with an option to add 2 Pillowcases.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input for personalization</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), King (102''x91'')</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
